cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its experimental results in your research,
  please cite this repository using the metadata below and identify the
  commit used for your experiments.
type: software
title: CNN-QR-phishing-detector
authors:
  - family-names: bnbong
    email: bbbong9@gmail.com
    website: https://github.com/bnbong
repository-code: https://github.com/bnbong/CNN-QR-phishing-detector
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Controlled experiments on phishing URL classification from canonical QR
  module grids without explicit QR decoding. The project evaluates
  classification performance, spatial arrangement, local motif interventions,
  linear probes, cross-dataset transfer, and campaign holdouts.
keywords:
  - QR codes
  - phishing
  - quishing
  - convolutional neural networks
  - controlled experiments
